## Developer

- [ ] **Clarify the encrypted-solutions workflow.**
  Document the end-to-end pipeline: how to author plain-text solutions, run
  `Scripts/encrypt_solutions.swift`, and embed the resulting ciphertext in the WorldData
  JSON files. Add a README section or a header comment in `encrypt_solutions.swift`
  describing each step, the required key material location, and how to verify output with
  `SolutionCrypto.decrypt(_:)` in a unit test.

- [ ] **Document how to run the unit test suite from Xcode.**
  The `PushboxTests` target contains suites for game logic, services, data, and
  integration. Add a section to `README.md` covering: select the `PushboxTests` scheme,
  press ⌘U, and interpret results in the Test navigator.

